Provides: missionplanner
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libicu76 | libicu75 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libgl1, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libice6, libsm6, libvlc5, vlc-plugin-base
