Description: Mission Planner 10 cross-platform ground control station
 Self-contained Avalonia .NET 10 port of ArduPilot Mission Planner.
 It supports flight planning, telemetry, parameter management, log analysis,
 simulation and vehicle setup.
 This is an independent community project and is not affiliated with ArduPilot.
